    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ReThink | Evolved 6 is a first person puzzle game in a peaceful futuristic setting, that features a variety of Puzzles that utilize Lasers and the behavior of light and it's colors to create challenging problems to solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use newly added and already proven gameplay mechanics to puzzle your way through the game's beautiful world, which is now filled with even more puzzles than in previous games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ReThink | Evolved 6 features more than 50 Puzzles that make use of newly introduced features and old ones alike, to keep the gears in your head turning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All puzzles follow the same set of rules, but often come with a twist that will make you think about your solution, and often rethink it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improvements over ReThink | Evolved 6:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusted and smoothed difficulty progression </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0New features and puzzle elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Improved performance </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Adjustments/Improvements to existing features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Improved Movement through the game </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also comes with  more adjustments and improvements.</p>",
